<title>SOUTH KOREA: Samsung wins $104 mln Singapore deal.</title>
<headline>Samsung wins $104 mln Singapore deal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The construction division of Samsung Corp said on Monday it had won a US$104 million contract to help reclaim land in Singapore.  </p>
<p>A Samsung statement said the order was awarded by Japan's Penta-Ocean Construction Co Ltd, the major contractor for Singapore's Jurong and Tuas reclamation project.</p>
<p>&quot;Penta Ocean wanted us to do the work for part of the project,&quot; a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
